## What Problem This Solves

Fixes an issue where Claude CLI sees human-readable OpenClaw Tooling labels followed by a generic exact-name instruction, while the actual MCP registration names appear later.

Fixes #198483

## Why This Change Was Made

The Claude-specific system-prompt transform now states the registered MCP name before the generic exact-call instruction. The message delivery hint remains conditional on the `message` tool being available.

## User Impact

Claude CLI receives callable OpenClaw tool names before it is told to call names exactly, reducing failed tool selections.

